WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.374
- I couldn't wait to grow a beard.

00:00:01.374 --> 00:00:03.269
I felt like that was a true marker

00:00:03.269 --> 00:00:05.098
of what it meant to be a man.

00:00:05.098 --> 00:00:07.671
In part, probably 'cause
my dad had a beard.

00:00:07.671 --> 00:00:10.091
And aren't we all just
trying to be our dads?

00:00:10.091 --> 00:00:13.796
(soft music)

00:00:13.796 --> 00:00:16.671
- Growing up, you always like
question your masculinity.

00:00:16.671 --> 00:00:18.918
- I've definitely
questioned my gender before.

00:00:18.918 --> 00:00:21.236
- I've always felt like a man,

00:00:21.236 --> 00:00:24.621
but not sure if I've always
been like a manly man.

00:00:24.621 --> 00:00:29.004
- I have been made to feel less than a man

00:00:29.004 --> 00:00:30.629
for a good chunk of my life.

00:00:30.629 --> 00:00:33.387
- I started really questioning
whether I was or not.

00:00:33.387 --> 00:00:34.869
- I tried fantasy football.

00:00:34.869 --> 00:00:36.235
I'm bad at it, I hate it,

00:00:36.235 --> 00:00:37.837
but I felt like if I didn't participate

00:00:37.837 --> 00:00:39.522
in my school's fantasy football group,

00:00:39.522 --> 00:00:40.631
that I wasn't a dude.

00:00:40.631 --> 00:00:44.318
- I had this pink salmon
lunchbox that I really liked.

00:00:44.318 --> 00:00:45.219
I was made fun of it.

00:00:45.219 --> 00:00:48.586
Both boys and girls told me
that I shouldn't have that,

00:00:48.586 --> 00:00:51.647
and so, that was the last time
I ever used that lunchbox.

00:00:51.647 --> 00:00:55.008
- My girlfriend's dad
said I wasn't a real man.

00:00:55.008 --> 00:00:56.699
When he said that, he
was referring to the fact

00:00:56.699 --> 00:00:59.671
that he didn't think that I
could be the man of the house

00:00:59.671 --> 00:01:01.110
if I were to marry his daughter.

00:01:01.110 --> 00:01:03.126
- You know it's those
microaggressions and macroaggressions

00:01:03.126 --> 00:01:06.209
that constantly wear at you,
that start making you question

00:01:06.209 --> 00:01:07.922
your right to be called a man.

00:01:07.922 --> 00:01:09.984
- Different points of my
life, I've been self-conscious

00:01:09.984 --> 00:01:12.696
of aspects of myself physically

00:01:12.696 --> 00:01:14.460
because I felt like it was an indication

00:01:14.460 --> 00:01:15.969
that I wasn't man enough.

00:01:15.969 --> 00:01:18.036
- Growing up a skinny
kid, like definitely,

00:01:18.036 --> 00:01:19.321
felt a little weaker.

00:01:19.321 --> 00:01:22.720
- As a short guy, everyone has
remarked at how small I am.

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:25.130
- I'm kinda skinny and lanky and awkward.

00:01:25.130 --> 00:01:26.407
If I could change a part of my body,

00:01:26.407 --> 00:01:27.935
I'd definitely add some muscle mass.

00:01:27.935 --> 00:01:29.514
- Because muscles make a man.

00:01:29.514 --> 00:01:32.203
A muscular man with a
six pack is an ideal.

00:01:32.203 --> 00:01:34.195
- My physical form,
I've worked really hard

00:01:34.195 --> 00:01:35.932
for it to look this way.

00:01:35.932 --> 00:01:37.766
- Getting stronger is amazing.

00:01:37.766 --> 00:01:39.527
The muscles starting to form.

00:01:39.527 --> 00:01:41.008
The look, the confidence.

00:01:41.008 --> 00:01:44.300
- A real man, I guess, is
anyone that identifies as a man

00:01:44.300 --> 00:01:45.618
that is not imaginary.

00:01:45.618 --> 00:01:48.075
- If you take away all
these societal expectations.

00:01:48.075 --> 00:01:49.092
- Protects women.

00:01:49.092 --> 00:01:50.340
- Take up a lot of space.

00:01:50.340 --> 00:01:51.223
- Needs to be tough.

00:01:51.223 --> 00:01:52.114
- Can't cry.

00:01:52.114 --> 00:01:53.317
- Cannot be gay.

00:01:53.317 --> 00:01:54.566
You really don't have anything else

00:01:54.566 --> 00:01:57.417
besides just someone
that identifies as a guy.

00:01:57.417 --> 00:01:59.553
- Because when we think too polemically

00:01:59.553 --> 00:02:02.753
about what makes a man
or what makes a woman,

00:02:02.753 --> 00:02:07.396
we erase all of the like giant space

00:02:07.396 --> 00:02:09.035
of what makes a person.

